WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.862 --> 00:00:03.771
JENTORRA
The Conqueror.

00:00:03.821 --> 00:00:06.572
He will burn the
world to find you.

00:00:08.091 --> 00:00:09.486
KANG THE CONQUEROR
If you want to stop what's coming...

00:00:09.935 --> 00:00:11.275
Better hurry, Ant-Man.

00:00:11.829 --> 00:00:12.646
CASSIE LANG
Dad!

00:00:12.697 --> 00:00:13.355
SCOTT LANG
I don't care who this guy is.

00:00:13.405 --> 00:00:14.314
This is my fight.

00:00:16.125 --> 00:00:17.076
SCOTT LANG
I'm coming for you!

00:00:19.834 --> 00:00:21.497
KANG THE CONQUEROR
You think you can beat me?

00:00:21.547 --> 00:00:22.548
I am Kang!

